00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Fallon Looney: No, yeah, I think that was self-explanatory. Um, I feel clear. It was cool because I, I think I was on her, like, I've just been kind of shadowing anything, like, just that comes up, um, in terms of, like, the initial calls, and so I actually shadowed, I think it was, like, Whitney's intro call with her, so it was cool to see her again. I was like, I remember her. She looks.

