Fallon Looney: Here.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: That's nice. That's cool. Uh, okay. So, yeah, I was like… I don't think I need to send her a loom of what I did yesterday, because I can just show her what I did, and it's just real time, so…

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah. Yeah, whatever is easier.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Alright, okay.

