00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah. Okay, so this is, of course, like, my Fathom recording, so what I do is I just copy the summary.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And then…

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, so and then in her tab.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.000
