00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And then where was the…

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, so I just, like, download it, make sure everything's there, and I'm gonna do that for the.

