Carmen Cruickshank: Because all I did this morning was just…

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: fill this in based on her intake form, and she basically just does, like, candid photography in Orlando and Denver. Uh, and then the keywords were also super easy, really wasn't that hard.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh…

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Um, yeah, so after what I do is what I said, like, the… I put the call things in the call recording folder, I scheduled the call with her.

